    "Profile events cover completed preparation attempts; cancelled attempts are omitted. Profile errors are attempt outcomes, not final browser-test failures, and are not attributed without error-code evidence.",
    "Private transport timers can be inclusive; no timer sums are interpreted as wall time or CPU.",
    "The profile has no request-correlated waterfall proving a critical chain.",
    "Local MinIO on tmpfs does not represent production S3.",
    "Serializer capacities are output Vec capacities, not total memory use or RSS."
